{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"APEC領導人非正式會議｜特朗普稱期望與習近平及普京舉行三方會談\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/APEC-TRUMP-261119-11.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】APEC領導人非正式會議開幕，美國總統特朗普亦在會上發言，稱期望與國家主席習近平，以及俄羅斯總統普京會談。</p><p>美國總統特朗普：「在中國此處，我很期待歷史性三方會談，會見習主席和普京總統，今日稍後會討論三方機遇。」</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T03:44:08.584142+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":1,"source":"Now 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T03:06:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T08:48:10.399776+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T03:37:26.679637+00:00","content_hash":"e137da99401f85e9da4669faa23da53568747aefcd7898fe5301a3e7c9086f11","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}